# a scene's key held to clear it: what its press did is taken back first, so clearing another scene needs no race
# against the bar line (a tester, 2026-10-23: "playing scene 3, hold scene 4 and SEL before it changes")
wait 300
bpm 120
scenedef 2 2
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
expect used 3
# an empty key held: its copy undone, nothing asked, scene 1 stays
key w2 down
wait 1100
expect ask 0
expect used 3
expect scene 1
key w2 up
# stopped: scene 2's key held asks; yes: scene 2 gone, back to scene 1 (the scene before the press)
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
key w1 up
tap SEL
wait 40
expect used 1
expect scene 1
# playing scene 1, scene 2's key held: its cue withdrawn while LOOM-8 asks (the bar line passes); yes: scene 2 gone
scenedef 2 2
tap PLAY
wait 300
key w1 down
wait 1100
expect ask 1
key w1 up
wait 2500
expect scene 1
tap SEL
wait 40
expect used 1
expect scene 1
# playing, an empty key held: nothing asked, nothing made, nothing cued
key w3 down
wait 1100
expect ask 0
key w3 up
wait 2500
expect scene 1
expect used 1
tap PLAY
